OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FARCHIVE: The TV Room
OL,7,
OL,8,F13th April marked the 30th anniversary
OL,9,Fof one of the boldest revamps of BBC
OL,10,FNews.
OL,11,
OL,12,FA new look package put the BBC News
OL,13,Fbrand to the fore and made it clear
OL,14,Fthat all the main BBC One news
OL,15,Fprogrammes were part of the same
OL,16,Ffamily.
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBNat RadioCReg RadioFNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13802
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F138A1768698054
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G2/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut the package also allowed each
OL,7,Fprogramme to retain some of its own
OL,8,Fidentity ` unlike the next revamp six
OL,9,Fyears later.
OL,10,
OL,11,FIt seems astonishing now that the main
OL,12,FBBC One programmes lost all but the
OL,13,Fmost subtle hints of a common identity
OL,14,Fin the mid-1980s.
OL,15,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBNat RadioCReg RadioFNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100
