OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis had long been the practice on ITV
OL,7,Fwhere each news bulletin had been seen
OL,8,Fas a programme in its own right ` News
OL,9,Fat One had a very different feel to
OL,10,FNews at 545 which in turn was quite
OL,11,Funlike News at Ten. The common link was
OL,12,FITN. But the look of the news service
OL,13,Fwas not of any corporate importance to
OL,14,Findividual ITV companies or the network
OL,15,Fitself.
OL,16,
OL,17,FBut why was this ever the case with the
OL,18,FBBC? An organisation with news at its
OL,19,Fvery centre.
OL,20,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBNat RadioCReg RadioFNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13804
SC,0004
