PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F138A1768698054
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G4/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 1981 revamp gave each of the three
OL,7,Fdaily programmes distinct personalities
OL,8,Fbut they still shared a common visual
OL,9,Fidentity.
OL,10,
OL,11,FThis broke down in the mid-80s. First
OL,12,Fthe new Six O'Clock News, then the Nine
OL,13,Fand finally the relaunched One had
OL,14,Ftheir own signature tunes, titles,
OL,15,Fgraphics and sets.
OL,16,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBNat RadioCReg RadioFNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13805
SC,0005
