PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F138A1768698054
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G5/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe relics of the 1981 look struggled
OL,7,Fon until 1988. Lambie Nairn's bold new
OL,8,Flook for the Nine was also adopted by
OL,9,Fthe weekend bulletins and became the
OL,10,Fnearest thing to a generic identity.
OL,11,
OL,12,FBut by the early 90s it was clear that
OL,13,Fthe emphasis had to be put on the BBC
OL,14,FNews brand.
OL,15,
OL,16,FThe new look did this.
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBNat RadioCReg RadioFNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100
