OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn impressive virtual reality set,
OL,7,Frearrangements by George Fenton of all
OL,8,Fthe news themes and a common graphics
OL,9,Fpackage were introduced.
OL,10,
OL,11,FBreakfast had a warm, pinkish glow. The
OL,12,FOne and the Six had slightly different
OL,13,Fblue backgrounds. The Nine had a
OL,14,Fparticularly impressive gold and dark
OL,15,Fblue set.
OL,16,
OL,17,FIt is interesting to review the package
OL,18,Fnow.
OL,19,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBNat RadioCReg RadioFNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100
