OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FPersonally I always felt the BBC
OL,7,Fcorporate logo of the time looked
OL,8,Fbetter on screen when it was shown in a
OL,9,Fsingle colour ` as it was on the
OL,10,Fchannel idents.
OL,11,
OL,12,FOn the BBC News and Sport titles the
OL,13,Ffull colour version was used which
OL,14,Falways tended to be a bit fussy.
OL,15,
OL,16,FThis was rectified when the new
OL,17,Fcorporate package was introduced in
OL,18,F1997.
OL,19,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBNat RadioCReg RadioFNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100
