OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe looks of the programmes were all
OL,7,Fimpressive though `B  including the
OL,8,Fseamless integration of the live shot
OL,9,Fof the presenter into the titles.
OL,10,
OL,11,FBut a couple of niggles.
OL,12,
OL,13,FThe rearranged signature tunes were so
OL,14,Fsimilar it might have been better to go
OL,15,Ffor just one.
OL,16,
OL,17,FSimilarly the set of the One had its
OL,18,Fown shade of blue with a vertical inset
OL,19,Fto the right of the screen.
OL,20,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBNat RadioCReg RadioFNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100
PN,13809
SC,0009
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F138A1768698054
OL,1,W{$~sj5j5h7}j7}          G9/11
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Six and the daytime summaries
OL,7,Fshared the same package though ` a
OL,8,Fslightly different shade of blue and a
OL,9,Fhorizontal inset on the left.
OL,10,
OL,11,FDid any viewer with no interest in such
OL,12,Fthings notice? If you're going to do
OL,13,Fsomething different, at least make it
OL,14,Fmeaningful. The One would have been as
OL,15,Fwell to look just like the Six and the
OL,16,Fdaytime summaries.
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBNat RadioCReg RadioFNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100
