OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FInterestingly the One was the only
OL,7,Fprogramme to undergo any significant
OL,8,Feditorial or format changes in this
OL,9,Frelaunch.
OL,10,
OL,11,FJohn Tusa and Edward Stourton took over
OL,12,Ffrom previous presenter Philip Hayton
OL,13,Fand a significant emphasis was placed
OL,14,Fon foreign news.
OL,15,
OL,16,FIn hindsight this was an unlikely
OL,17,Fdevelopment for a lunchtime programme
OL,18,Fshown between Pebble Mill in its chat
OL,19,Fshow incarnation and Neighbours but it
OL,20,Fspeaks of the BBC under John Birt.
OL,21,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBNat RadioCReg RadioFNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100
