OL,3,GFEATURES CRemembering the 1993 refresh
OL,4,Cof BBC One news branding
OL,5,
OL,6,FAll in all, the look survived 6 years
OL,7,Falthough Breakfast got its own identity
OL,8,Fback earlier.
OL,9,
OL,10,FIt looks (and sounds) quite different
OL,11,Fto the BBC News package we have become
OL,12,Faccustomed to since 1999.
OL,13,
OL,14,FBut it was a successful and innovative
OL,15,Fpackage worth celebrating which should
OL,16,Fbe remembered positively.
OL,17,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBNat RadioCReg RadioFNat Sport
FL,139,120,200,300,0,100@
